ext-sm mb-4\"><a href=\"/ikonomika/struktura#sabitiya\">← <!-- -->Решения и събития</a></p><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">2022</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Енергийна криза и война в Украйна</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Скок на цените на енергията и инфлация над 13% (по ХИПЦ, Евростат).</div></div></div><section class=\"mb-12\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Три години преди и три години след</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-4 max-w-3xl\">Средно за <!-- -->2019<!-- -->–<!-- -->2021<!-- --> г. срещу <!-- -->2022<!-- -->–<!-- -->2024<!-- --> г. Данните се обновяват сами с всяка нова година от Евростат. Съвпадението във времето не доказва, че събитието е причината.</p><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full text-[15px] num\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-rule text-left\"><th class=\"py-2 pr-3\">Показател</th><th class=\"px-2 text-right\">Преди</th><th class=\"px-2 text-right\">След</th><th class=\"px-2 text-right\">Промяна</th><th class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">ЕС преди → след</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/gdp_growth\">Реален растеж на БВП</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">2,3%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">2,9%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-[#2f9e6a]\">+0,6</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">0,9 → 1,8</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/inflation\">Инфлация</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">2,2%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">8,1%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-red\">+5,9</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">1,7 → 6,1</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/unemployment\">Безработица</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">5,5%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">4,2%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-[#2f9e6a]\">-1,3</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">7 → 6,1</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/employment_rate\">Заетост (20–64 г.)</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">73,4%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">76,3%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-[#2f9e6a]\">+2,9</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">72,5 → 75,2</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/investment\">Инвестиции</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">18%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">17,9%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">-0</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">21,9 → 21,8</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/exports\">Износ</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">60,8%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">62,9%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">+2,1</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">47,9 → 52,4</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/deficit\">Бюджетно салдо</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">-1,9%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">-2,6%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-red\">-0,8</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">-3,9 → -3,2</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/debt\">Държавен дълг</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">22,8%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">23%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-red\">+0,2</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">84,5 → 81</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/gov_expenditure\">Държавни разходи</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">% от БВП</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">39,8%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">39,6%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">-0,2</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">50,2 → 48,9</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/ikonomika/investicii\">Нови чужди инвестиции</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">млн. €</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">1699,6 млн. €</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">3430,6 млн. €</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-[#2f9e6a]\">+1730,9</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\"></td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/house_prices\">Поскъпване на жилищата</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">%</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">6,4%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">13,4%</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold \">+7</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">6,3 → 3,7</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-rule\"><td class=\"py-2 pr-3\"><a href=\"/statistiki/net_migration\">Нетна миграция</a> <span class=\"text-xs text-muted\">на 1000 души</span></td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">1,1</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right\">5,6</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right font-semibold text-[#2f9e6a]\">+4,5</td><td class=\"px-2 text-right text-muted\">2,2 → 6,6</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-2\">Зелено: промяната е към по-добро за хората, червено: към по-лошо. Сравнението с ЕС показва дали промяната е само у нас или навсякъде.</p></section><section class=\"grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2 mb-12\"><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Реален растеж, %</h3><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold 